<!--    - The 1980 census category list (20 of up to 34 codes) was      -->
<!--      pulled directly from the actual POPGRP variable codebook,     -->
<!--      South Africa Population Census 1980, hosted by the World      -->
<!--      Bank Microdata Library - a primary source, not a secondary    -->
<!--      summary.                                                      -->
<!--    - Population Registration Act Repeal Act, 1991 (Act No. 114 of  -->
<!--      1991), assented 27 June 1991, commenced 28 June 1991 - ended  -->
<!--      legal racial classification.                                  -->
<!--    - Khalfani, A.A. and Zuberi, T. (2001). "Racial classification  -->
