<!--  I could not verify one specific claim relayed to the user by      -->
<!--  ChatGPT (a purported verbatim Stats SA statement that population- -->
<!--  group classification "was used by the apartheid government to    -->
<!--  divide the population into distinct groups on which apartheid     -->
<!--  policies were based") as an exact quotable line from a specific   -->
<!--  Stats SA document, so it is NOT quoted below. The underlying      -->
<!--  substance is well supported by other means instead - multiple     -->
<!--  independent sources confirm the Population Registration Act was  -->
<!--  the legal foundation later apartheid segregation laws (Group      -->
<!--  Areas Act 1950, Bantu Authorities Act 1951) were built on - and   -->
<!--  that substance is what is stated below, without the disputed      -->
<!--  quote attribution.                                                -->
